dsh-harnessmm
Copyright 2026 dsh-plugin

This product ports the runtime mechanism of HarnessMM:
  HarnessMM: Recursive Self-Improvement for Harness Token Efficiency
  Yuhua Jiang, Chang Xu, Feifei Gao, Li Zhao
  https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.32813
  https://github.com/YuhuaJiang2002/HarnessMM  (Apache-2.0)

and follows the pi extension that ports it:
  pi-harnessmm
  https://github.com/jlon/pi-harnessmm  (Apache-2.0)

The authoring contract, bank parsing rules, guard semantics, admission
arithmetic and the certified-native-substitution/v1 certificate schema are
derived from those projects and remain under the Apache-2.0 license. The dsh
adaptation (native shell dispatch through a registered dsh tool, session-log
authoring receipts, ledger routes and the terminal tool surface) is original
work in this repository.
